**\n   \\[\n   4 + 6 + 1 (\\text{carry}) = 11 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n   \\]\n   \n10. **Billions Place:**\n    \\[\n    0 + 0 + 1 (\\text{carry}) = 1 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1)\n    \\]\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!110,\\!280,\\!420}\n\\].Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
